<PageTitle>Privacy Policy - Mekanika</PageTitle>

<div class="page-header">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>How Mekanika handles your data — last updated [EFFECTIVE DATE]</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><h2>Summary</h2></div>
    <div class="policy-body">
        <p>
            Mekanika is a free engineering-calculation tool that runs in your browser.
            <strong>Your calculation inputs are processed entirely on your device</strong>
            and are never sent to a server unless you choose to save them to an account.
            We do not sell your data. This page explains what is collected, why, and the
            choices you have.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><h2>Who is responsible</h2></div>
    <div class="policy-body">
        <p>
            The data controller for this site is <strong>[LEGAL ENTITY / OPERATOR NAME]</strong>,
            operating <strong>mekanika.org</strong>. For any privacy question or request,
            contact <a href="mailto:contact@@mekanika.org">contact@@mekanika.org</a>.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><h2>What we collect, and why</h2></div>
    <div class="policy-body">
        <div class="about-section-label">Calculations you run</div>
        <p>
            Inputs you type into a calculator are processed locally in your browser using
            WebAssembly. They are <strong>not transmitted to any server</strong> while you
            calculate, and a shareable link you generate encodes those inputs into the link
            itself — we do not store it.
        </p>

        <div class="about-section-label" style="margin-top: 20px;">If you create an account (optional)</div>
        <p>
            Accounts are optional. The tool works fully without one. If you sign up, we
            process:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Your email address</strong> — to identify your account and sign you in.</li>
            <li><strong>An optional display name and company</strong> — only if you enter them.</li>
            <li>
                <strong>Calculations you explicitly save</strong> — the input values and a
                title you give them, so you can reopen them later.
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            The legal basis is performance of the service you request (providing your
            account and saved work). Authentication and this data are handled by our
            processor, <strong>Supabase</strong>, on servers in the <strong>European Union
            (Frankfurt, Germany)</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="about-section-label" style="margin-top: 20px;">Analytics</div>
        <p>
            We use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> to understand which calculators are
            used, in aggregate, so we can improve them. This sets cookies and collects usage
            data such as pages visited and approximate location. The legal basis is your
            consent and our legitimate interest in improving the service.
        </p>

        <div class="about-section-label" style="margin-top: 20px;">Advertising</div>
        <p>
            This site may display ads through <strong>Google AdSense</strong>, which can use
            cookies to serve and measure ads. You can manage ad personalisation via
            <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ad Settings</a>.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><h2>What we never do</h2></div>
    <div class="policy-body">
        <ul>
            <li>We do not sell or rent your personal data.</li>
            <li>We do not upload your calculation inputs to a server unless you save them.</li>
            <li>We do not use your saved calculations for advertising.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><h2>How long we keep it</h2></div>
    <div class="policy-body">
        <p>
            Account data and saved calculations are kept until you delete them or close your
            account. When you delete your account, your profile and all your saved
            calculations are permanently removed. Analytics data is retained according to
            Google's retention settings.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><h2>Your rights</h2></div>
    <div class="policy-body">
        <p>
            Under GDPR and KVKK you have the right to access, correct, export, or delete your
            personal data, and to withdraw consent. In the app you can:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Delete your account and all saved data</strong> yourself, from your account settings.</li>
            <li>Edit or remove any individual saved calculation.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            For anything else, email <a href="mailto:contact@@mekanika.org">contact@@mekanika.org</a>
            and we will respond within the period required by [APPLICABLE LAW / JURISDICTION].
            You also have the right to lodge a complaint with your local data protection
            authority.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><h2>Cookies</h2></div>
    <div class="policy-body">
        <p>
            The calculators themselves do not require cookies. Cookies are used by the
            analytics and advertising services above, and, if you sign in, a token is stored
            in your browser to keep you logged in. You can clear these at any time through
            your browser settings.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><h2>Changes</h2></div>
    <div class="policy-body">
        <p>
            We may update this policy as the service evolves. Material changes will be
            reflected in the "last updated" date above.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

